---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service - Varaha">
  <nav class="border-b border-white/10 glass backdrop-blur-md">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex h-16 items-center justify-between">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-8">
          <a href="/" class="flex items-center space-x-2 relative">
            <img src="/mandala2.svg" alt="Varaha Logo" class="w-10 h-10 object-contain scale-110 opacity-40 animate-spin animate-duration-1000" style="filter: brightness(0) invert(1) sepia(1) saturate(2) hue-rotate(15deg) brightness(1.2);" />
            <span class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white tracking-widest transform -translate-x-5">varaha<span class="text-brand-purple">.ai</span></span>
          </a>
          <div class="hidden md:flex space-x-6">
            <a href="/docs" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors">Docs</a>
            <a href="/pricing" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors">Pricing</a>
            <a href="/dashboard" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-white transition-colors">Dashboard</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="py-16 px-4">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-300">Last updated: April 5, 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-enhanced rounded-xl border border-white/10 p-8 space-y-8">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
            By accessing and using Varaha ("the Service"), you accept and agree to be bound by the terms and provision of this agreement. 
            If you do not agree to abide by the above, please do not use this service.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">2. Description of Service</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
            Varaha provides a high-performance LLM proxy service that enables users to execute specialized AI tasks 
            including text summarization, information extraction, classification, rewriting, and chat completions. 
            The service is delivered on a subscription basis with usage-based pricing.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">3. User Accounts and Registration</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p>
              <strong>3.1 Account Creation:</strong> You must provide accurate and complete information to create an account.
              You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>3.2 Account Security:</strong> You are solely responsible for all activities under your account. 
              You must notify us immediately of any unauthorized use.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>3.3 Account Termination:</strong> We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts 
              that violate these terms or engage in fraudulent activity.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">4. Acceptable Use Policy</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p><strong>Permitted Uses:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Commercial and non-commercial AI task execution</li>
              <li>Text processing and analysis</li>
              <li>Integration into your applications and services</li>
              <li>Research and development purposes</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>Prohibited Uses:</strong></p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside ml-6 space-y-2">
              <li>Illegal activities or content generation</li>
              <li>Harassment, hate speech, or discriminatory content</li>
              <li>Spam generation or mass automated requests</li>
              <li>Intellectual property infringement</li>
              <li>Malicious use including malware development</li>
              <li>Attempting to circumvent rate limits or security measures</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">5. API Keys and Security</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p>
              <strong>5.1 API Key Responsibility:</strong> API keys are confidential and must not be shared. 
              You are responsible for all usage of your API keys.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>5.2 Key Rotation:</strong> We recommend regular API key rotation. 
              Report compromised keys immediately.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>5.3 Rate Limiting:</strong> API usage is subject to rate limits to ensure fair usage. 
              Excessive requests may be throttled.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">6. Payment and Billing</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p>
              <strong>6.1 Subscription Fees:</strong> Service is provided on a subscription basis with usage-based pricing. 
              Fees are charged in advance on a monthly or annual basis.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>6.2 Usage Charges:</strong> Additional charges may apply for usage beyond included limits. 
              All charges are clearly displayed in your dashboard.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>6.3 Payment Method:</strong> You must provide valid payment information. 
              We reserve the right to suspend service for non-payment.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>6.4 Refunds:</strong> Refunds are handled according to our Refund Policy. 
              Partial refunds may be provided for unused portions of billing cycles.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">7. Service Availability</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p>
              <strong>7.1 Uptime Commitment:</strong> We strive to maintain 99.9% service availability. 
              Scheduled maintenance may cause temporary interruptions.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>7.2 No Warranty:</strong> The service is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. 
              We do not guarantee uninterrupted or error-free operation.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>7.3 Service Modifications:</strong> We reserve the right to modify or discontinue 
              the service with reasonable notice to affected users.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">8. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p>
              <strong>8.1 Service Ownership:</strong> Varaha retains all rights to the service, 
              including software, documentation, and intellectual property.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>8.2 User Content:</strong> You retain ownership of content you input and generate. 
              By using the service, you grant us a license to process your content for service delivery.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>8.3 Feedback:</strong> Any suggestions or improvements you provide become our property 
              and may be used to improve the service without compensation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p>
              <strong>9.1 Service Limitation:</strong> To the maximum extent permitted by law, 
              Varaha shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>9.2 Maximum Liability:</strong> Our total liability for any claims shall not 
              exceed the amount you paid for the service in the preceding 12 months.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>9.3 Force Majeure:</strong> We are not liable for failures due to 
              circumstances beyond our reasonable control, including natural disasters or third-party service failures.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">10. Termination</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p>
              <strong>10.1 User Termination:</strong> You may terminate your account at any time 
              through your dashboard or by contacting support. No cancellation fees apply.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>10.2 Service Termination:</strong> We may terminate or suspend access 
              immediately for violations of these terms or fraudulent activity.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>10.3 Effect of Termination:</strong> Upon termination, your right to use 
              the service ceases immediately. We may delete your data after 30 days.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">11. Governing Law</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
            These terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the jurisdiction 
            where Varaha operates, without regard to conflict of law provisions.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">12. Changes to Terms</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
            We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Users will be notified of 
            significant changes via email or dashboard notifications. Continued use of the service 
            constitutes acceptance of modified terms.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mb-4">13. Contact Information</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <p><strong>Support:</strong> For questions about these terms, contact us at:</p>
            <div class="glass-enhanced rounded-lg p-4 border border-white/10">
              <p>Email: support@varaha.ai</p>
              <p>Website: https://varaha.ai</p>
              <p>Response Time: Within 24 business hours</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 text-center">
        <a href="/privacy" class="text-brand-purple hover:text-brand-blue transition-colors mr-6">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/refund-policy" class="text-brand-purple hover:text-brand-blue transition-colors mr-6">Refund Policy</a>
        <a href="/dpa" class="text-brand-purple hover:text-brand-blue transition-colors">Data Processing Agreement</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
